{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43133","headline":"九嶷山 · 刘望","name":"九嶷山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鼎湖冠劒有遗踪，晋汉真人羽化同。\n九转药成丹竈冷，五车云去玉堂空。\n仙家日月蓬壶里，尘世烟花梦寐中。\n徒有旧山流水畔，老松枝叶苦吟风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘望","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43133.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43133","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}